[{"date":"2022-12-24T06:54:19.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","description":"However, we find that there is a necessity for a language-specific CLIP for applications, especially cross-modal retrieval, and there is no opensourced Chinese CLIP with good performance. We therefore launched this project to promote the Chinese multimodal representation learning.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":22,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01Ayrj141Z6v6o0otgL_!!6000000003146-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Chinese CLIP: Contrastive Vision-Language Pretraining in Chinese","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Research"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/assets/blog/cnclip/search.jpg","word_count":4498,"id":"chinese-clip","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/chinese-clip/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"CLIP[^1] is a phenomenal playmaker in vision and multimodal representation learning. It plays not only as a foundation model but also a bridge between vision and language. It has triggered a series of","authors":["QwenTeam"]},{"date":"2024-04-16T05:33:00.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Today, we are delighted to introduce a new member of the Qwen1.5 open-source family, the CodeQwen1.5-7B, a specialized codeLLM built upon the Qwen1.5 language model.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":39,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN018fmQVa1hHvYNVqCuw_!!6000000004253-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Code with CodeQwen1.5","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/assets/blog/codeqwen1.5/intro.png","word_count":7741,"math":true,"id":"codeqwen1.5","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/codeqwen1.5/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"The advent of advanced programming tools, which harnesses the power of large language models (LLMs), has significantly enhanced programmer productivity and accuracy. Notwithstanding these advancements"},{"date":"2025-01-20T16:00:03.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"The Mixture-of-Experts (MoEs) architecture has become a popular model-parameter-scale-up technique.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":22,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01JH0zOD1QBef4OeeC9_!!6000000001938-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Global-batch load balance almost free lunch to improve your MoE LLM training","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Research"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/assets/balance/main_results.png","word_count":4466,"math":true,"id":"global-load-balance","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/global-load-balance/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"The Mixture-of-Experts (MoEs) architecture has become a popular model-parameter-scale-up technique. Typically, one MoE layer consists of a router (often parameterized as one single Linear layer) and a"},{"date":"2025-07-27T07:00:00.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"show_word_count":true,"readTime":29,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN0123XiTi1edxlJi3WKt_!!6000000003895-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"GSPO: Towards Scalable Reinforcement Learning for Language Models","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Research"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/results.jpg#center","word_count":5740,"math":true,"id":"gspo","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/gspo/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"Reinforcement Learning (RL) has emerged as a pivotal paradigm for scaling language models and enhancing their deep reasoning and problem-solving capabilities. To scale RL, the foremost prerequisite is"},{"date":"2022-11-14T08:01:41.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":2,"description":"2022 is a year of generalist models! With the bloom of multimodal pretraining, especially the unified model, we have witnessed the opportunity to building a generalist model that is capable of processing tasks of different modalities or multi-modalities! ","show_word_count":true,"readTime":39,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01gPY1pH1eB6oHfVgrk_!!6000000003832-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"OFA: Towards Building a One-For-All Model","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Research"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/assets/blog/ofa/uniter.jpg","word_count":7733,"id":"ofa","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/ofa/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"2022 is a year of generalist models! With the bloom of multimodal pretraining, especially the unified model, we have witnessed the opportunity to building a generalist model that is capable of process"},{"date":"2022-12-28T10:01:21.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","description":"Therefore, we propose OFASys, an AI framework targeting multimodal multitask learning.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":30,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN012Ygfqw1M8DDmt996q_!!6000000001389-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"OFASys: Enabling Multitask Learning with One Line of Code! ","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Research"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/assets/blog/ofasys/demo.jpg","word_count":6060,"id":"ofasys","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/ofasys/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"Generalist Models are hot! We all see an opportunity towards a real generalist model by multimodal multitask learning. We previously release an opensourced unified multimodal pretrained model OFA for "},{"date":"2024-12-24T16:00:03.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Imagine an AI that can look at a complex physics problem, and methodically reason its way to a solution with the confidence of a master physicist. This vision inspired us to create QVQ - an open-weight model for multimodal reasoning, built upon Qwen2-VL-72B.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":21,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01NnpNB71gquBYp5Pxh_!!6000000004194-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"QVQ: To See the World with Wisdom","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Release"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/QVQ/QVQ.jpg","word_count":4100,"math":true,"id":"qvq-72b-preview","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qvq-72b-preview/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"Language and vision intertwine in the human mind, shaping how we perceive and understand the world around us. Our ability to reason is deeply rooted in both linguistic thought and visual memory - but "},{"date":"2025-03-27T16:00:04.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Today, we are officially releasing the first version of QVQ-Max, our visual reasoning model.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":26,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN018onW8W1DwHz54wSs4_!!6000000000280-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"QVQ-Max: Think with Evidence","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Release"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/QVQ-Max/test_time.png","word_count":5271,"draft":false,"math":true,"id":"qvq-max-preview","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qvq-max-preview/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"Last December, we launched QVQ-72B-Preview as an exploratory model, but it had many issues. Today, we are officially releasing the first version of QVQ-Max, our visual reasoning model. This model can "},{"date":"2024-01-23T14:13:29.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"4 months after our first release of Qwen-7B, which is the starting point of our opensource journey of large language models (LLM), we now provide an introduction to the Qwen series to give you a whole picture of our work as well as our objectives.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":27,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01hkVY7m1vfeh4TZKRq_!!6000000006200-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Introducing Qwen","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Release"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/assets/blog/qwen/family.png","word_count":5402,"id":"qwen","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen/index.json","lastmod":"2024-01-22T16:00:00.000Z","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"4 months after our first release of Qwen-7B, which is the starting point of our opensource journey of large language models (LLM), we now provide an introduction to the Qwen series to give you a whole"},{"date":"2024-06-06T03:59:59.000Z","summary":"We've created an agent using Qwen2 models with an 8k context size to understand documents with 1M tokens, surpassing RAG and native long-context models. This agent was also used to generate data for training new long-context Qwen models.","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"We’ve created an agent using Qwen2 models with an 8k context size to understand documents with 1M tokens, surpassing RAG and native long-context models.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":43,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01i4Q6AR23XQVIi6lS8_!!6000000007265-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Generalizing an LLM from 8k to 1M Context using Qwen-Agent","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Research"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/assets/qwen_agent/qwen-agent-2405-lv1-agent.png","word_count":8681,"id":"qwen-agent-2405","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen-agent-2405/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"**TLDR:** We've created an agent using Qwen2 models with an 8k context size to understand documents with 1M tokens, surpassing RAG and native long-context models. This agent was also used to generate "},{"date":"2025-08-04T14:08:30.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"show_word_count":true,"readTime":25,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01DLyyGs1bYWCqvLkzC_!!6000000003477-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen-Image: Crafting with Native Text Rendering","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Research"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/merge3.jpg#center","word_count":4909,"draft":false,"math":true,"id":"qwen-image","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen-image/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"We are thrilled to release **Qwen-Image**, a 20B MMDiT image foundation model that achieves significant advances in complex text rendering and precise image editing. To try the latest model, feel free"},{"date":"2025-08-18T17:30:00.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"show_word_count":true,"readTime":29,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01RXSS4P23dq33QGnKo_!!6000000007279-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen-Image-Edit: Image Editing with Higher Quality and Efficiency","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Research"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit_homepage.jpg#center","word_count":5778,"draft":false,"math":true,"id":"qwen-image-edit","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen-image-edit/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"We are excited to introduce Qwen-Image-Edit, the image editing version of Qwen-Image. Built upon our 20B Qwen-Image model, Qwen-Image-Edit successfully extends Qwen-Image's unique text rendering capab"},{"date":"2025-09-22T16:08:30.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"show_word_count":true,"readTime":12,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01CIdGkP1CCevoNngH3_!!6000000000045-2-tps-1590-954.png","title":"Qwen-Image-Edit-2509: Multi-Image Support, Improved Consistency","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/edit2509/edit2509_top.jpg#center","word_count":2300,"draft":false,"math":true,"id":"qwen-image-edit-2509","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen-image-edit-2509/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"This September, we are pleased to introduce Qwen-Image-Edit-2509, the monthly iteration of Qwen-Image-Edit. To experience the latest model, please visit [Qwen Chat](https://qwen.ai)  and select the \"I"},{"date":"2024-05-11T10:10:00.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Previously, we opensourced a series of Qwen1.5 model ranging from 0.5 to 110 billion parameters. Now, we release a larger model, Qwen-Max-0428.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":5,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01xS57GM1QpxW0ZCG2X_!!6000000002026-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Notes on Qwen-Max-0428","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Release"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/arena_leaderboard.jpg","word_count":954,"math":true,"id":"qwen-max-0428","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen-max-0428/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"Previously, we opensourced a series of Qwen1.5 model ranging from 0.5 to 110 billion parameters. Now, we release a larger model, Qwen-Max-0428. Qwen-Max-0428 is an instruction-tuned model for chat ser"},{"date":"2024-03-28T03:31:44.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Today, we introduce Qwen1.5-MoE-A2.7B, a small MoE model with only 2.7 billion activated parameters yet matching the performance of state-of-the-art 7B models like Mistral 7B and Qwen1.5-7B.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":41,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN014wNJhC1kHsMAfWFpM_!!6000000004659-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen1.5-MoE: Matching 7B Model Performance with 1/3 Activated Parameters","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Release"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/assets/blog/qwen1.5/qwen-moe.jpg","word_count":8257,"math":true,"id":"qwen-moe","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen-moe/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"Since the surge in interest sparked by Mixtral, research on mixture-of-expert (MoE) models has gained significant momentum. Both researchers and practitioners are keenly interested in understanding ho"},{"date":"2025-07-24T14:00:00.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"show_word_count":true,"readTime":23,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01mADZAp1UuJkNlERCM_!!6000000002577-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen-MT: Where Speed Meets Smart Translation","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Research"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/qwen-mt-001.jpeg","word_count":4683,"math":true,"id":"qwen-mt","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen-mt/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"Here we introduce the latest update of Qwen-MT (qwen-mt-turbo) via [Qwen API](https://modelstudio.console.alibabacloud.com/?tab=doc#/doc/?type=model&url=https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/doc-detail"},{"date":"2025-06-27T07:01:30.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Here we introduce the latest update of Qwen-TTS (qwen-tts-latest or qwen-tts-2025-05-22) through Qwen API . Trained on a large-scale dataset encompassing over millions of hours of speech, Qwen-TTS achieves human-level naturalness and expressiveness. Notably, Qwen-TTS automatically adjusts prosody, pacing, and emotional inflections in response to the input text. Notably, Qwen-TTS supports the generation of 3 Chinese dialects, including Pekingese, Shanghainese, and Sichuanese.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":8,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01rAfdGa221zhrdVE8M_!!6000000007061-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Time to Speak Some Dialects, Qwen-TTS!","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Release"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"","word_count":1544,"draft":false,"math":true,"id":"qwen-tts","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen-tts/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"Here we introduce the latest update of **Qwen-TTS** (`qwen-tts-latest` or `qwen-tts-2025-05-22`) through [Qwen API](https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/qwen-tts) . Trained on a large-scale dataset"},{"date":"2024-01-25T05:33:00.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Along with the rapid development of our large language model Qwen, we leveraged Qwen’s capabilities and unified multimodal pretraining to address the limitations of multimodal models in generalization, and we opensourced multimodal model Qwen-VL in Sep. 2023. Recently, the Qwen-VL series has undergone a significant upgrade with the launch of two enhanced versions, Qwen-VL-Plus and Qwen-VL-Max.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":31,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01qEwYVn1RlfQ3jmcAr_!!6000000002152-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Introducing Qwen-VL","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Release"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"","word_count":6236,"draft":false,"math":true,"id":"qwen-vl","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen-vl/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"Along with the rapid development of our large language model Qwen, we leveraged Qwen’s capabilities and unified multimodal pretraining to address the limitations of multimodal models in generalization"},{"date":"2025-06-26T14:00:04.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","description":"From the initial QwenVL to the latest Qwen2.5 VL, we have made progress in enhancing the model’s ability to understand image content. Today, we are excited to introduce a new model, Qwen VLo, a unified multimodal understanding and generation model.","weight":1,"show_word_count":true,"readTime":39,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01h8zlPf1K0lYBrVOU2_!!6000000001102-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen VLo: From \"Understanding\" the World to \"Depicting\" It","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Release"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-VLo/vlo.png","word_count":7821,"draft":false,"math":true,"id":"qwen-vlo","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen-vlo/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"The evolution of multimodal large models is continually pushing the boundaries of what we believe technology can achieve. From the initial QwenVL to the latest Qwen2.5 VL, we have made progress in enh"},{"date":"2024-02-04T05:33:00.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"With Qwen1.5, we are open-sourcing base and chat models across six sizes: 0.5B, 1.8B, 4B, 7B, 14B, 32B, 72B, and 110B, and also an MoE model (see blog for more information).","show_word_count":true,"readTime":70,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01yFtQhb1eLBWVKbHXJ_!!6000000003854-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Introducing Qwen1.5","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/assets/blog/qwen1.5/intro.jpg","word_count":13990,"math":true,"id":"qwen1.5","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen1.5/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"In recent months, our focus has been on developing a \"good\" model while optimizing the developer experience. As we progress towards **Qwen1.5**, the next iteration in our Qwen series, this update arri"},{"date":"2024-04-25T05:33:00.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Today, we release the first 100B+ model of the Qwen1.5 series, Qwen1.5-110B, which achieves comparable performance with Meta-Llama3-70B in the base model evaluation, and outstanding performance in the chat evaluation, including MT-Bench and AlpacaEval 2.0.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":13,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01vfdPqh25i4wmsaCus_!!6000000007559-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen1.5-110B: The First 100B+ Model of the Qwen1.5 Series","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Release"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"","word_count":2669,"math":true,"id":"qwen1.5-110b","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen1.5-110b/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"Recently we have witnessed a burst of large-scale models with over 100 billion parameters in the opensource community. These models have demonstrated remarkable performance in both benchmark evaluatio"},{"date":"2024-04-02T05:33:00.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Qwen1.5-32B is a new member of the Qwen1.5 language model series, and besides model sizes, there is almost nothing different in model architecture except for the inclusion grouped query attention (GQA). ","show_word_count":true,"readTime":18,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01FJuMNI1EzKE29cJaY_!!6000000000422-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen1.5-32B: Fitting the Capstone of the Qwen1.5 Language Model Series","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Release"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/assets/blog/qwen1.5-32b/32b.png","word_count":3691,"math":true,"id":"qwen1.5-32b","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen1.5-32b/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"The open-source community has long sought a model that strikes an ideal balance between performance, efficiency, and memory footprint. Despite the emergence of cutting-edge models like Qwen1.5-72B and"},{"date":"2024-06-06T16:00:00.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"After months of efforts, we are pleased to announce the evolution from Qwen1.5 to Qwen2.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":67,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01oKhdZr1j6azCVU5Ex_!!6000000004499-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Hello Qwen2","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/assets/blog/qwen2/qwen.jpg","word_count":13424,"math":true,"id":"qwen2","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2/index.json","lastmod":"2024-07-15T16:00:00.000Z","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"After months of efforts, we are pleased to announce the evolution from Qwen1.5 to Qwen2. This time, we bring to you:We have opensourced the models in Hugging Face and ModelScope to you and we are look"},{"date":"2024-08-09T08:18:19.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Today, we release Qwen2-Audio, the next version of Qwen-Audio, which is capable of accepting audio and text inputs and generating text outputs.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":16,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01gYXp0M1dwS8UOaQBr_!!6000000003800-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen2-Audio: Chat with Your Voice!","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen2-Audio/demo/radar_compare_qwen_audio.png","word_count":3287,"draft":false,"math":true,"id":"qwen2-audio","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2-audio/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"To achieve the objective of building an AGI system, the model should be capable of understanding information from different modalities. Thanks to the rapid development of large language models, LLMs a"},{"date":"2024-08-07T16:00:00.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Qwen2-Math is a series of specialized math language models built upon the Qwen2 LLMs, which significantly outperforms the mathematical capabilities of open-source models and even closed-source models (e.g., GPT-4o).","show_word_count":true,"readTime":24,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01CEdMM02511iWTPvnu_!!6000000007465-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Introducing Qwen2-Math","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Release"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/assets/blog/qwen2-math/fig1.jpg","word_count":4820,"math":true,"id":"qwen2-math","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2-math/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"**🚨 This model mainly supports English. We will release bilingual (English and Chinese) math models soon.**Over the past year, we have dedicated significant effort to researching and enhancing the re"},{"date":"2024-08-28T16:24:00.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","description":"After a year’s relentless efforts, today we are thrilled to release Qwen2-VL! Qwen2-VL is the latest version of the vision language models based on Qwen2 in the Qwen model familities.","weight":1,"show_word_count":true,"readTime":43,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN014TFaLH1L3LObKr3aD_!!6000000001243-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen2-VL: To See the World More Clearly","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen2-VL/qwen2vl-head.jpeg","word_count":8663,"draft":false,"math":true,"id":"qwen2-vl","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2-vl/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"After a year's relentless efforts, today we are thrilled to release **Qwen2-VL**! Qwen2-VL is the latest version of the vision language models based on **Qwen2** in the Qwen model familities. Compared","authors":["QwenTeam"]},{"date":"2024-09-18T16:00:04.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Today, we are excited to introduce the latest addition to the Qwen family: Qwen2.5. We are announcing what might be the largest opensource release in history! Let’s get the party started!","show_word_count":true,"readTime":66,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN0102k1Cr1Nq0iEVrSyO_!!6000000001620-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen2.5: A Party of Foundation Models!","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"http://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen2.5/Qwen2.5%20modelcard.001.jpeg","word_count":13161,"math":true,"id":"qwen2.5","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2.5/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"In the past three months since Qwen2's release, numerous developers have built new models on the Qwen2 language models, providing us with valuable feedback. During this period, we have focused on crea"},{"date":"2025-01-26T16:00:03.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Two months after upgrading Qwen2.5-Turbo to support context length up to one million tokens, we are back with the open-source Qwen2.5-1M models and the corresponding inference framework support.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":49,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01VPK3rY1y1l2TcnRy1_!!6000000006519-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen2.5-1M: Deploy Your Own Qwen with Context Length up to 1M Tokens","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen2.5-1M/passkey_retrieval.png","word_count":9766,"math":true,"id":"qwen2.5-1m","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2.5-1m/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"Two months after upgrading [Qwen2.5-Turbo](../qwen2.5-turbo) to support context length up to one million tokens, we are back with the open-source Qwen2.5-1M models and the corresponding inference fram"},{"date":"2024-09-18T16:00:02.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Today, we are excited to announce the release of the next generation of open-source coding models, Qwen2.5-Coder, and officially rename CodeQwen to Qwen-Coder.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":20,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01mLq5fi1eItXkE3Czw_!!6000000003849-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen2.5-Coder: Code More, Learn More!","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen2.5/Qwen2.5-Coder/coder-main.png","word_count":3903,"math":true,"id":"qwen2.5-coder","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2.5-coder/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"In early April, we introduced CodeQwen1.5, which garnered significant attention from the community. Since then, we have been working to enhance the coding model. Today, we are excited to announce the "},{"date":"2024-11-11T16:00:02.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Today, we are excited to open source the “Powerful”, “Diverse”, and “Practical” Qwen2.5-Coder series, dedicated to continuously promoting the development of Open CodeLLMs.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":35,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01jQ4vU91nfdkpmxdu9_!!6000000005117-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen2.5-Coder Series: Powerful, Diverse, Practical.","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen2.5/Qwen2.5-Coder-Family/32b-top.jpg","word_count":7004,"math":true,"id":"qwen2.5-coder-family","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2.5-coder-family/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"Today, we are excited to open source the \"Powerful\", \"Diverse\", and \"Practical\" Qwen2.5-Coder series, dedicated to continuously promoting the development of Open CodeLLMs.Additionally, the multi-langu"},{"date":"2024-09-18T16:00:03.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"In this blog, we delve into the details of our latest Qwen2.5 series language models.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":52,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01SVeaRN1U0tp7yfRYk_!!6000000002456-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen2.5-LLM: Extending the boundary of LLMs","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Research"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"","word_count":10400,"math":true,"id":"qwen2.5-llm","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2.5-llm/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"In this blog, we delve into the details of our latest Qwen2.5 series language models. We have developed a range of decoder-only dense models, with seven of them open-sourced, spanning from 0.5B to 72B"},{"date":"2024-09-18T16:00:01.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Today, we have upgraded it and open-sourced Qwen2.5-Math series, including base models Qwen2.5-Math-1.5B/7B/72B, instruction-tuned models Qwen2.5-Math-1.5B/7B/72B-Instruct, and mathematical reward model Qwen2.5-Math-RM-72B.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":47,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01GOEJky1diiFo5ek9M_!!6000000003770-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen2.5-Math: The world's leading open-sourced mathematical LLMs","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"http://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen2.5/2024-08-qwen2.5-math-72B.png","word_count":9388,"math":true,"id":"qwen2.5-math","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2.5-math/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"**🚨 Qwen2.5-Math mainly supports solving English and Chinese math problems through CoT and TIR. We do not recommend using this series of models for other tasks.**A month ago, we released the first se"},{"date":"2025-01-13T16:00:03.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Today, we release a new state-of-the-art PRM that outperforms existing open-source alternatives for future research in building process supervision models.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":24,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01OSlKdt1bSZ3cFUpX5_!!6000000003464-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Towards Effective Process Supervision in Mathematical Reasoning","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Release"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"http://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/Qwen2.5/Qwen2.5-Math-PRM/Qwen2.5-Math-PRM.png","word_count":4774,"math":true,"id":"qwen2.5-math-prm","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2.5-math-prm/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"In recent years, Large Language Models (LLMs) have made remarkable advances in mathematical reasoning, yet they can make mistakes, such as miscalculations or logical errors, leading to wrong conclusio"},{"date":"2025-01-28T15:00:04.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Concurrently, we are developing Qwen2.5-Max, a large-scale MoE model that has been pretrained on over 20 trillion tokens and further post-trained with curated Supervised Fine-Tuning (SFT) and Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback (RLHF) methodologies.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":19,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN0132o2E81svHMDRbZdV_!!6000000005828-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen2.5-Max: Exploring the Intelligence of Large-scale MoE Model","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Release"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/Qwen2.5-max-banner.png","word_count":3736,"math":true,"id":"qwen2.5-max","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2.5-max/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"It is widely recognized that continuously scaling both data size and model size can lead to significant improvements in model intelligence. However, the research and industry community has limited exp"},{"date":"2025-03-26T16:00:45.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"We release Qwen2.5-Omni, the new flagship end-to-end multimodal model in the Qwen series.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":21,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01GVuL0G1XWRxG74IKH_!!6000000002931-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen2.5 Omni: See, Hear, Talk, Write, Do It All!","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/Qwen2.5-Omni/qwen_omni.png","word_count":4238,"draft":false,"math":true,"id":"qwen2.5-omni","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2.5-omni/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"We release **Qwen2.5-Omni**, the new flagship end-to-end multimodal model in the Qwen series. Designed for comprehensive multimodal perception, it seamlessly processes diverse inputs including text, i"},{"date":"2024-11-14T16:00:03.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"After the release of Qwen2.5, we heard the community’s demand for processing longer contexts. In recent months, we have made many optimizations for the model capabilities and inference performance of extremely long context.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":29,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01SeMiF024thNW91dLw_!!6000000007449-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Extending the Context Length to 1M Tokens!","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Release"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen2.5-Turbo/cover_en.png","word_count":5779,"math":true,"id":"qwen2.5-turbo","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2.5-turbo/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"After the release of Qwen2.5, we heard the community's demand for processing longer contexts. In recent months, we have made many optimizations for the model capabilities and inference performance of "},{"date":"2025-01-26T11:08:30.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"We release Qwen2.5-VL, the new flagship vision-language model of Qwen and also a significant leap from the previous Qwen2-VL.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":32,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01X7ff9q1QcDdIi7Ph4_!!6000000001996-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen2.5 VL! Qwen2.5 VL! Qwen2.5 VL!","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/Qwen2.5-vl-Capybara.png","word_count":6386,"draft":false,"math":true,"id":"qwen2.5-vl","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2.5-vl/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"We release **Qwen2.5-VL**, the new flagship vision-language model of Qwen and also a significant leap from the previous Qwen2-VL. To try the latest model, feel free to visit [Qwen Chat](https://chat.q"},{"date":"2025-03-23T16:00:04.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"Building on the Qwen2.5-VL series, we continued to optimize the model using reinforcement learning and open-sourced the new VL model with the beloved 32B parameter scale under the Apache 2.0 license — Qwen2.5-VL-32B-Instruct.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":11,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01iCwLhw1Hl4kYUm5rB_!!6000000000797-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen2.5-VL-32B: Smarter and Lighter","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen2.5-VL-32B/qwen2.5vl-32b-vision.jpg","word_count":2191,"draft":false,"math":true,"id":"qwen2.5-vl-32b","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen2.5-vl-32b/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"At the end of January this year, we launched the Qwen2.5-VL series of models, which received widespread attention and positive feedback from the community. Building on the Qwen2.5-VL series, we contin"},{"date":"2025-04-28T20:00:00.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"We are open-weighting two MoE models: Qwen3-235B-A22B, a large model with 235 billion total parameters and 22 billion activated parameters, and Qwen3-30B-A3B, a smaller MoE model with 30 billion total parameters and 3 billion activated parameters. Additionally, six dense models are also open-weighted, including Qwen3-32B, Qwen3-14B, Qwen3-8B, Qwen3-4B, Qwen3-1.7B, and Qwen3-0.6B, under Apache 2.0 license.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":48,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01EJM5sy23hVDXqN07i_!!6000000007287-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen3: Think Deeper, Act Faster","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/qwen3-banner.png","word_count":9682,"math":true,"id":"qwen3","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"Today, we are excited to announce the release of **Qwen3**, the latest addition to the Qwen family of large language models. Our flagship model, **Qwen3-235B-A22B**, achieves competitive results in be"},{"date":"2025-09-08T06:38:04.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","show_word_count":true,"readTime":14,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i2/O1CN01BCuUM01FaQKUOSFCE_!!6000000000503-2-tps-1590-954.png","title":"Qwen3 ASR: Hear clearly, transcribe smartly.","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Research"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-ASR/qwenasr-bear2.png#center","word_count":2715,"draft":true,"id":"qwen3-asr-flash","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-asr-flash/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"We introduce Qwen3-ASR-Flash, a speech recognition service built upon the strong intelligence of Qwen3-Omni and large amount of multi-modal data especially ASR data on the scale of tens of millions ho"},{"date":"2025-07-22T13:00:00.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"show_word_count":true,"readTime":31,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01bzvTND1zoaswjOuqr_!!6000000006761-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"Qwen3-Coder: Agentic Coding in the World","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Research"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Coder/qwen3-coder-main.jpg","word_count":6238,"math":true,"id":"qwen3-coder","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-coder/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"Today, we're announcing Qwen3-Coder, our most agentic code model to date. Qwen3-Coder is available in multiple sizes, but we're excited to introduce its most powerful variant first: Qwen3-Coder-480B-A"},{"date":"2025-06-05T13:00:00.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"We release Qwen3 Embedding series, a new proprietary model of the Qwen model family. These models are specifically designed for text embedding, retrieval, and reranking tasks, built on the Qwen3 foundation model.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":23,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN01rxbtmx1blLISPGLPx_!!60000