afety classificatoin, Qwen"},{"date":"2025-03-05T16:00:04.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","description":"We are excited to introduce QwQ-32B, a model with 32 billion parameters that achieves performance comparable to DeepSeek-R1, which boasts 671 billion parameters (with 37 billion activated).","weight":1,"show_word_count":true,"readTime":19,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN012xm8Cw1OKhFTItwHC_!!6000000001687-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"QwQ-32B: Embracing the Power of Reinforcement Learning","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Open-Source"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/qwq-32b-final.jpg","word_count":3709,"math":true,"id":"qwq-32b","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwq-32b/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"Scaling Reinforcement Learning (RL) has the potential to enhance model performance beyond conventional pretraining and post-training methods. Recent studies have demonstrated that RL can significantly","authors":["QwenTeam"]},{"date":"2024-11-27T16:00:03.000Z","show_code_copy_buttons":true,"author":"QwenTeam","weight":1,"description":"What does it mean to think, to question, to understand? These are the deep waters that QwQ (Qwen with Questions) wades into.","show_word_count":true,"readTime":27,"cover_small":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i3/O1CN018w4xvj1u3oLqye6H8_!!6000000005982-2-tps-1890-1134.png","title":"QwQ: Reflect Deeply on the Boundaries of the Unknown","show_reading_time":true,"tags":["Release"],"show_post_nav_links":false,"cover":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/assets/blog/qwq-32b-preview/QwQ-32B-Preview_result.png","word_count":5374,"math":true,"id":"qwq-32b-preview","tokenLinks":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwq-32b-preview/index.json","show_bread_crumbs":true,"introduction":"*Note: This is the pronunciation of QwQ: /kwju:/ , similar to the word \"quill\".*What does it mean to think, to que